        <Param val="Welcome to the study!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this session, you will alternate between rest and video blocks. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;During rest blocks, a fixation cross will appear in the centre of the screen. Please focus on the cross throughout the block. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;During video blocks, you will watch a series of short video clips. Please watch each clip until it ends.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;At the end of each block, you will be asked a series of questions about how you feel.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The session follows this sequence:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rest → Videos → Rest → Videos → Rest&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;When you are ready to begin, press the SPACEBAR.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
